            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "To drop off? (ಉದುರು, uduru.) To improve? (ಸುಧಾರಿಸು, sudhārisu.) To support? (ಬೆಂಬಲಿಸು, bembalisu.) To burst? (ಸಿಡಿ, siḍi.) To snore? (ಗೊರಕೆ ಹೊಡೆ, gorake hoḍe.) The forehead? (ಹಣೆ, haṇe.) The throat? (ಗಂಟಲು, gaṇṭalu.) The heel? (ಹಿಮ್ಮಡಿ, himmaḍi.) The thigh? (ತೊಡೆ, toḍe.) The palm? (ಅಂಗೈ, aṅgai.) Patience? (ತಾಳ್ಮೆ, tāḷme.) Jealousy? (ಅಸೂಯೆ, asūye.) Loneliness? (ಒಂಟಿತನ, oṇṭitana.) Curiosity? (ಕುತೂಹಲ, kutūhala.) A feeling? (ಭಾವನೆ, bhāvane.) Childbirth? (ಹೆರಿಗೆ, herige.) Eyesight? (ದೃಷ್ಟಿ, dṛṣṭi.) An infection? (ಸೋಂಕು, sōṅku.) A blister? (ಬೊಕ್ಕೆ, bokke.) Nutritious? (ಪೌಷ್ಟಿಕ, pauṣṭika.)"
            }
          ]
        }
